@startuml
node "Customer device" {
  artifact "Browser / PWA" as PWA
}
node "GitHub Actions" {
  artifact "Quality gate and CD" as CI
}
cloud "GHCR image : SHA" as REG
artifact "Git branch production\nKustomize overlay + image tags" as GIT
node "Oracle Cloud VM / K3s" {
  component "Argo CD" as ARGO
  component "Traefik Ingress" as INGRESS
  node "Web Deployment and Service" as WEB {
    artifact "Next.js standalone : 3000" as NEXT
  }
  node "API Deployment and Service" as API {
    artifact "NestJS + Prisma : 3001" as NEST
  }
  database "PostgreSQL : 5432\nClusterIP and PVC" as DB
}
node "Developer local" {
  artifact "Docker Compose web/api/db" as LOCAL
  artifact ".env local" as ENV
}
PWA --> INGRESS : HTTPS after TLS setup
INGRESS --> WEB : HTTP 3000
WEB --> API : HTTP 3001 / API proxy
API --> DB : PostgreSQL private connection
CI --> REG : push SHA (GITHUB_TOKEN)
CI --> GIT : update both image tags
GIT --> ARGO : watch and sync
ARGO --> WEB : reconcile
ARGO --> API : reconcile
WEB --> REG : image pull via K3s
API --> REG : image pull via K3s
API --> DB : init container migration and catalog seed
API --> API : /api/health + logs
ENV ..> LOCAL : local configuration
note bottom of CI
Boundaries: local / CI / production. Runtime secrets in platform secret store. DB has no public ingress.
end note
@enduml
